SUMMARY:Pumpkin Crankie Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a new and exciting workshop event Saturday Oct.24th! Bring your own pumpkin or snag a limited pre-carved pumpkin and tell your own spooky\, silly\, classic halloween tale at a Pumpkin Crankie Workshop! Hosted by the local\, amazingly talented artist Elizabeth Blackwell! Elizabeth is a master in the art of crankie’s and runs “We are Crankie!” along with the annual crankie fest here in Bloomington Indiana! \nEvent is located in the Lotus Firebay at 105 S. Rogers\, Bloomington Indiana. The workshop will run from 4 pm – 6 pm. Limited pre-carved pumpkins and supplies are available for individuals or groups for a 15 dollar ticket per pumpkin! Groups and Individuals are welcome to bring a pre-carved pumpkin for a discounted ticket price of 10 dollars to help us cover the cost of crankie materials! \nAll ages\, abilities\, people are welcome! Just bring your creativity and good energy! \nRegister and Purchase your Ticket \n\nNotes for all guests! \nLimited Parking is available in the Regions Bank Lot located directly behind Lotus Education & Arts Foundation.  Otherwise there is street parking available along Fourth street\, Rogers\, and in residential neighborhoods west of the FAR Gallery.  \nIt is 15 dollar value for pre-carved pumpkins and crankie making supplies.  Groups or individuals are welcome to bring a pre-carved pumpkin to the event for a 10 dollar event/supply fee.  Groups and Individuals are allowed to purchase single or multiple pumpkins!  We will supply one pre-carved pumpkin per 15 dollar entry fee.   \n#Crankie #PumpkinCrankie #LotusFest # Lotus #LetsCreate”
URL:https://www.lotusfest.org/event/pumpkin-crankie-workshop/
LOCATION:Lotus Firebay\, 105 S Rogers Street\, Bloomington\, IN\, 47404\, United States
CATEGORIES:Firebay Rental
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.lotusfest.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Site-Event-Images.png
END:VEVENT
